#~ msgstr "安定性"

#~ msgid "**A zero threshold.** With `practical_delta_pct = 0.0` an exact tie is reported as `Faster`."
#~ msgstr "**ゼロの閾値。** `practical_delta_pct = 0.0` では、完全な同値が `Faster` と報告されます。"

#~ msgid "`document_from_jsonl` parses observations, validations, failure artifacts, and summaries into plot and differential IR."
#~ msgstr "`document_from_jsonl`: observation、validation、failure artifact、summary を plot/differential IR に変換します。"

#~ msgid "Plot projection excludes invalid or infrastructure-failed `(case, implementation, dataset)` keys, invalid observations, and discarded batches."
#~ msgstr "plot projection は invalid/infrastructure failure の `(case, implementation, dataset)`、invalid observation、discarded batch を除外します。"

#~ msgid "`plot_json` emits valid escaped `mmks_1` JSON."
#~ msgstr "`plot_json`: escape 済み `mmks_1` JSON を生成します。"

#~ msgid "`plot_svg` emits accessible SVG with dynamic scales, axes, labels, legends, tooltips, and series colors."
#~ msgstr "`plot_svg`: dynamic scale、axis、label、legend、tooltip、series color を持つ SVG。"

#~ msgid "`html` emits a report with mismatch rows, flags diffs, capability coverage, corpus denominators, minimal counterexamples, inline CSS, and SVG."
#~ msgstr "`html`: mismatch、flags diff、capability coverage、corpus denominator、minimal counterexample、inline CSS/SVG を含む report。"

#~ msgid "Scaling, interval, and change-point plots connect per-series category averages. Raw distribution, block order, outlier, and Pareto plots use points. Heatmap plots use colored cells. Exact signatures are in `src/report/pkg.generated.mbti`."
#~ msgstr "Scaling、interval、change-point は series average を線で結びます。raw distribution、 block order、outlier、Pareto は point、heatmap は cell を使います。正確な signature は `src/report/pkg.generated.mbti` を参照してください。"

#~ msgid "`Implementation::in_process` registers a stateful callback; `Implementation::worker` registers a native isolated subprocess. Both accept an optional blocking `synchronize` hook for asynchronous backends."
#~ msgstr "`Implementation::in_process`: stateful callback、`Implementation::worker`: native isolated subprocess を登録します。どちらも async backend 用の blocking `synchronize` hook を設定できます。"

#~ msgid "`WorkerSpec::new` defines argument encoding, output decoding, timeout, and working directory."
#~ msgstr "`WorkerSpec::new`: argument encode、output decode、timeout、working directory を定義します。"

#~ msgid "`OutputSink::new` folds outputs during the timed batch, then retains the finished value with `Bench::keep` after the clock stops."
#~ msgstr "`OutputSink::new`: output を fold し、`Bench::keep` で値を保持します。"

#~ msgid "`single_step` builds an immutable common-case description; its combinators return new values and `compile` aggregates configuration errors."
#~ msgstr "`single_step`: immutable な common-case description を作り、combinator は新しい値を返し、`compile` は configuration error を集約します。"

#~ msgid "`ValidatedBenchPlan` and `ValidatedProtocol` are the only inputs accepted by the runtime boundary."
#~ msgstr "`ValidatedBenchPlan` と `ValidatedProtocol`: runtime boundary が受け取る唯一の configuration type です。"

#~ msgid "`ProtocolPreset` provides `QuickCheck`, `Development`, `RegressionGate`, and validated custom protocols."
#~ msgstr "`ProtocolPreset`: `QuickCheck`、`Development`、`RegressionGate`、validated custom protocol を提供します。"

#~ msgid "`RunContext` groups protocol, environment, observation sink, and seed."
#~ msgstr "`RunContext`: protocol、environment、observation sink、seed をまとめます。"

#~ msgid "`balanced_order` rotates implementation order by block id."
#~ msgstr "`balanced_order`: block id ごとに実行順を回転します。"

#~ msgid "`run(plan, context)` fingerprints input, validates every sequence step outside timing, shrinks failures, emits replay artifacts, then measures balanced batches and returns `RunSummary`."
#~ msgstr "`run(plan, context)`: fingerprint、計時外 validation/shrink、balanced measurement、event 発行、reset を行い `RunSummary` を返します。"

#~ msgid "`run` calibrates each implementation toward the configured target batch time, caps work at the iteration and sample-time bounds, and applies a common batch size only when `SharedBatchSize` is selected. Exploratory and confirmatory observations remain separate phases."
#~ msgstr "`run` は implementation ごとに target batch time へ calibration し、iteration と sample-time の上限を適用します。`SharedBatchSize` の場合だけ共通 batch size を使い、 exploratory と confirmatory observation は別 phase として保存します。"

#~ msgid "The JSONL summary records the complete `EnvironmentSnapshot`, including device, thread/concurrency count, and frequency policy. Use `stats.summarize` over repeated valid observations for median-based reporting."
#~ msgstr "JSONL summary は device、thread/concurrency count、frequency policy を含む完全な `EnvironmentSnapshot` を記録します。繰り返した valid observation は `stats.summarize` で median に集約できます。"

#~ msgid "See `src/runner/pkg.generated.mbti` for exact generic signatures."
#~ msgstr "正確な generic signature は `src/runner/pkg.generated.mbti` を参照してください。"

